    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 20</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXIIII} Gif feorcund mon oððe fremde butan wege geond wudu gonge ⁊ ne hrieme ne horn blawe, for ðeof he bið to profianne: oððe to sleanne oððe to áliesanne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If [either] a person who has come from far off or a stranger travels off the road through the woods and does not shout out or blow a horn, he is to be taken for a thief: either to be slain or to be redeemed [by ransom].</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man from afar, or a stranger, travels through a wood off the highway and neither shouts nor blows a horn, he shall be assumed to be a thief, and as such may be either slain or put to ransom.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif feorcund mon oððe fremde butan wege geond wudu gonge ⁊ ne hryme ne horn blawe, for ðeof he bið to profianne: oððe to sleanne oþþe to lysanne.</ab>
      </div>
